</li>
<li data-start="5939" data-end="5976">
<p data-start="5941" data-end="5976">A monotonic mapping between the two</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5978" data-end="5981">
<h1 data-start="5983" data-end="6003"><strong data-start="5985" data-end="6003">In Plain Terms</strong></h1>
<p data-start="6004" data-end="6127">The paper demonstrates that <strong data-start="6032" data-end="6127">language understanding in the human brain unfolds in time the way an LLM unfolds in layers.</strong></p>
<p data-start="6129" data-end="6149">RSVP predicted that:</p>
<ul data-start="6151" data-end="6397">
<li data-start="6151" data-end="6192">
<p data-start="6153" data-end="6192">Cognition = recursive field evolution</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6193" data-end="6238">
<p data-start="6195" data-end="6238">Later semantic states require longer time</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6239" data-end="6282">
<p data-start="6241" data-end="6282">Nonlinear transformations are necessary</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6283" data-end="6330">
<p data-start="6285" data-end="6330">Symbolic parsing is biologically irrelevant</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6331" data-end="6397">
<p data-start="6333" data-end="6397">High-level meaning integrates information over ~500 ms windows</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6399" data-end="6441">All of these appear in the empirical data.</p>
<p data-start="6443" data-end="6549"><strong data-start="6443" data-end="6549">This paper could serve as one of the strongest empirical supports for RSVP’s cognitive claims to date.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="6551" data-end="6554">
<h1 data-start="6556" data-end="6589"><strong data-start="6558" data-end="6589">If you want, I can produce:</strong></h1>
<ul data-start="6591" data-end="6958">
<li data-start="6591" data-end="6683">
<p data-start="6593" data-end="6683"><strong data-start="6593" data-end="6650">A formal section you can drop into the RSVP monograph</strong>, citing this paper as evidence</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6684" data-end="6771">
<p data-start="6686" data-end="6771"><strong data-start="6686" data-end="6771">A mathematical mapping from the layer-depth function to RSVP’s recursive operator</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="6772" data-end="6841">
<p data-start="6774" data-end="6841"><strong data-start="6774" data-end="6821">A proposed experiment to test RSVP directly</strong> using ECoG or MEG</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6842" data-end="6901">
<p data-start="6844" data-end="6901"><strong data-start="6844" data-end="6899">A diagram-free conceptual figure rewritten in LaTeX</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="6902" data-end="6958">
<p data-start="6904" data-end="6958"><strong data-start="6904" data-end="6956">A 1-to-1 table: “RSVP claim → empirical finding”</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6960" data-end="6993" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Just tell me the format you want.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474