</li>
<li data-start="2938" data-end="2990">
<p data-start="2940" data-end="2990">exchanges phase-coded information with neighbors</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2991" data-end="3039">
<p data-start="2993" data-end="3039">locks into multi-scale oscillatory resonance</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3040" data-end="3114">
<p data-start="3042" data-end="3114">collectively approximates arbitrary functions on the semantic manifold</p>
</li>
