<p data-start="755" data-end="899">Let me now give you a <strong data-start="777" data-end="815">precise, formalized interpretation</strong> that integrates the Cabral/Shemesh resonance-modes paper directly into your theory.</p>
<hr data-start="901" data-end="904">
<h1 data-start="906" data-end="969"><strong data-start="908" data-end="969">1. What the 2023 Ultrafast fMRI Study Actually Discovered</strong></h1>
