<ol data-start="1004" data-end="1392">
<li data-start="1004" data-end="1075">
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1075"><strong data-start="1007" data-end="1075">Long-range cortical activity is not primarily propagating waves.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1076" data-end="1225">
<p data-start="1079" data-end="1138">It is instead a <strong data-start="1095" data-end="1137">superposition of stationary eigenmodes</strong>:</p>
