</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5457" data-end="5487">This yields a unified picture:</p>
<h3 data-start="5489" data-end="5563">LLM depth ↔ temporal depth ↔ resonant eigenmode depth ↔ semantic depth</h3>
<p data-start="5565" data-end="5605">Your model predicted exactly this chain.</p>
