<p data-start="337" data-end="394">I kept <strong data-start="344" data-end="362">all your ideas</strong>, but polished and strengthened:</p>
<ul data-start="396" data-end="665">
<li data-start="396" data-end="411">
<p data-start="398" data-end="411">Definitions</p>
