</li>
<li data-start="512" data-end="556">
<p data-start="514" data-end="556">The empirical alignment with ECoG + fMRI</p>
</li>
<li data-start="557" data-end="597">
<p data-start="559" data-end="597">The universal approximation argument</p>
</li>
<li data-start="598" data-end="638">
<p data-start="600" data-end="638">The gating/synchronization mechanism</p>
</li>
<li data-start="639" data-end="665">
