<p data-start="5199" data-end="5264">This synchronizes local amplistwistor cascades across the cortex.</p>
<p data-start="5266" data-end="5392">Low-frequency modes (e.g., 2–5 Hz) govern long integration windows (~300–500 ms), matching deep semantic processing in IFG/TP.</p>
