<h1 data-start="1556" data-end="1599"><strong data-start="1558" data-end="1599">1. RSVP: The Semantic Field Substrate</strong></h1>
<p data-start="1601" data-end="1698">RSVP defines cognitive dynamics on a <strong data-start="1638" data-end="1683">relativistic scalar-vector-entropy plenum</strong> consisting of:</p>
<ul data-start="1700" data-end="1953">
