<p data-start="2341" data-end="2378">RSVP is the <strong data-start="2353" data-end="2377">substrate of meaning</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="2380" data-end="2450">But meaning does not simply “settle”—it evolves through <strong data-start="2436" data-end="2449">recursion</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="2452" data-end="2493">That recursion is supplied by <strong data-start="2482" data-end="2492">TARTAN</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="2495" data-end="2498">
<h1 data-start="2500" data-end="2544"><strong data-start="2502" data-end="2544">2. TARTAN: The Recursive Update Engine</strong></h1>
<p data-start="2546" data-end="2669">TARTAN (Trajectory-Aware Recursive Tiling with Annotated Noise) is the <strong data-start="2617" data-end="2668">mechanism by which RSVP fields update over time</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start="2671" data-end="2691">TARTAN performs:</h3>
<ul data-start="2692" data-end="2866">
<li data-start="2692" data-end="2723">
<p data-start="2694" data-end="2723">multiscale recursive tiling</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2724" data-end="2768">
<p data-start="2726" data-end="2768">trajectory-dependent semantic refinement</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2769" data-end="2825">
<p data-start="2771" data-end="2825">annotated noise injection (structured perturbations)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2826" data-end="2866">
<p data-start="2828" data-end="2866">temporal smoothing and stabilization</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2868" data-end="2910">TARTAN defines the <strong data-start="2887" data-end="2909">recursion operator</strong>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="script">R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>↦</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_t: (\Phi, \mathbf{v}, S)_{t} \mapsto (\Phi, \mathbf{v}, S)_{t+\delta t}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathcal">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose"><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">↦</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose"><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03785em;">δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3004" data-end="3054">Each recursion step updates the RSVP fields using:</p>
<ul data-start="3056" data-end="3168">
<li data-start="3056" data-end="3082">
<p data-start="3058" data-end="3082">local <strong data-start="3064" data-end="3082">amplistwistors</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3083" data-end="3120">
<p data-start="3085" data-end="3120">global <strong data-start="3092" data-end="3120">cymatic resonance cycles</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3121" data-end="3147">
<p data-start="3123" data-end="3147">noise-informed smoothing</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3148" data-end="3168">
<p data-start="3150" data-end="3168">trajectory buffers</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3170" data-end="3267">Thus <strong data-start="3175" data-end="3196">RSVP is the field</strong>, while <strong data-start="3204" data-end="3266">TARTAN is the algorithmic engine that evolves it over time</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="3269" data-end="3272">
<h1 data-start="3274" data-end="3335"><strong data-start="3276" data-end="3335">3. Amplistwistors: Local Nonlinear Transformation Rules</strong></h1>
<p data-start="3337" data-end="3464">Amplistwistors generalize Needham’s <em data-start="3373" data-end="3385">amplitwist</em> (derivative = amplify + twist) into nonlinear operators acting on RSVP fields.</p>
<p data-start="3466" data-end="3525">For local cortical-column computation, an amplistwistor is:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="script">A</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{A}_{\text{local}}
  = (\alpha, \tau, \pi),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathcal">A</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1132em;">τ</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3586" data-end="3592">where:</p>
<ul data-start="3594" data-end="3844">
<li data-start="3594" data-end="3655">
<p data-start="3596" data-end="3655"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha(\psi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>: amplitude modulation (gain on features)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3656" data-end="3716">
<p data-start="3658" data-end="3716"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau(\psi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1132em;">τ</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>: twist (rotation/shear in semantic space)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3717" data-end="3782">
<p data-start="3719" data-end="3782"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi(\psi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>: projection (dimension reduction or constraint)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3783" data-end="3844">
<p data-start="3785" data-end="3844"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi = (\Phi,\mathbf{v},S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> is the RSVP semantic field</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3846" data-end="3859">Local update:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{k+1} = \pi(\alpha(\psi_k)\,\tau(\psi_k)\psi_k).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9028em; vertical-align: -0.2083em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1132em;">τ</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3922" data-end="4006">This is a <strong data-start="3932" data-end="3965">neural-universal approximator</strong> step—one “layer” of semantic refinement.</p>
<p data-start="4008" data-end="4047">TARTAN sequences these steps over time:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="script">A</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi mathvariant="script">A</mi><mo>∘</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>∘</mo><mi mathvariant="script">A</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{t+\delta t} = \mathcal{A} \circ \mathcal{A} \circ \cdots \circ \mathcal{A} (\psi_t),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9028em; vertical-align: -0.2083em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03785em;">δ</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∘</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∘</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4445em;"></span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∘</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">A</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ψ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4147" data-end="4246">producing <strong data-start="4157" data-end="4183">amplistwistor cascades</strong>, i.e., recursive deep transformations analogous to LLM layers.</p>
<hr data-start="4248" data-end="4251">
<h1 data-start="4253" data-end="4313"><strong data-start="4255" data-end="4313">4. Cymatic Resonance: Global Eigenmode Synchronization</strong></h1>
<p data-start="4315" data-end="4405">The cortical sheet supports <strong data-start="4343" data-end="4375">global stationary eigenmodes</strong>, confirmed by ultrafast fMRI:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">r</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_m(\mathbf{r}, t) = u_m(\mathbf{r})e^{i\omega_m t},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">ϕ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">r</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.1247em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">r</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">e</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8747em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1645em;"><span style="top: -2.357em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.0714em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.143em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4470" data-end="4475">with:</p>
<ul data-start="4477" data-end="4711">
<li data-start="4477" data-end="4524">
<p data-start="4479" data-end="4524"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_m(\mathbf{r})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">r</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>: spatial standing waves</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4525" data-end="4563">
<p data-start="4527" data-end="4563"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5806em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>: resonant frequencies</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4564" data-end="4607">
<p data-start="4566" data-end="4607">modes spanning large cortical distances</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4608" data-end="4655">
<p data-start="4610" data-end="4655">mode reduction under anesthesia or disorder</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4656" data-end="4711">
<p data-start="4658" data-end="4711">coherence without explicit point-to-point signaling</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4713" data-end="4726">Global field:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">r</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R(\mathbf{r}, t) = \sum_{m=1}^M c_m(t)\,u_m(\mathbf{r})e^{i\omega_m t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">r</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 3.0954em; vertical-align: -1.2671em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.8283em;"><span style="top: -1.8829em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span><span class="mrel mtight">=</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span><span class="mop op-symbol large-op">∑</span></span></span><span style="top: -4.3em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3.05em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.2671em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathbf">r</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">e</span><span class="