<p data-start="5453" data-end="5468">Interpretation:</p>
<ul data-start="5470" data-end="5696">
<li data-start="5470" data-end="5511">
<p data-start="5472" data-end="5511"><strong data-start="5472" data-end="5480">RSVP</strong> provides the semantic fields</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5512" data-end="5564">
<p data-start="5514" data-end="5564"><strong data-start="5514" data-end="5524">TARTAN</strong> provides the recursive time evolution</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5565" data-end="5621">
<p data-start="5567" data-end="5621"><strong data-start="5567" data-end="5585">Amplistwistors</strong> give local nonlinear update rules</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5622" data-end="5696">
<p data-start="5624" data-end="5696"><strong data-start="5624" data-end="5656">Cymatic resonance eigenmodes</strong> synchronize and gate updates globally</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5698" data-end="5736">This is the full computational engine.</p>
