<h1 data-start="5743" data-end="5788"><strong data-start="5745" data-end="5788">6. Alignment with Neuroscience and LLMs</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="5790" data-end="5836"><strong data-start="5794" data-end="5836">ECoG (2025): Layer–Time Correspondence</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="5838" data-end="6010">
<li data-start="5838" data-end="5890">
<p data-start="5840" data-end="5890">early neural peaks = shallow amplistwistor steps</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5891" data-end="5942">
<p data-start="5893" data-end="5942">late peaks (300–500 ms) = deep TARTAN recursion</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5943" data-end="5971">
<p data-start="5945" data-end="5971">smooth monotonic mapping</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5972" data-end="6010">
<p data-start="5974" data-end="6010">nonlinear transformations required</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="6012" data-end="6057"><strong data-start="6016" data-end="6057">Ultrafast fMRI (2023): Standing Waves</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="6059" data-end="6183">
<li data-start="6059" data-end="6098">
<p data-start="6061" data-end="6098">global eigenmodes = resonance gates</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6099" data-end="6143">
<p data-start="6101" data-end="6143">long-range synchrony without propagation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6144" data-end="6183">
<p data-start="6146" data-end="6183">mode reduction → impaired recursion</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="6185" data-end="6197"><strong data-start="6189" data-end="6197">LLMs</strong></h3>
<p data-start="6199" data-end="6299">LLM layers = amplistwistor steps<br data-start="6231" data-end="6234">
Forward pass = one TARTAN rollout<br data-start="6267" data-end="6270">
Hidden states = RSVP fields</p>
<p data-start="6301" data-end="6306">Thus:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LLM&nbsp;depth</mtext><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo>↔</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>TARTAN&nbsp;recursion&nbsp;depth</mtext><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo>↔</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>cortical&nbsp;temporal&nbsp;depth</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{LLM depth}
\quad\leftrightarrow\quad
\text{TARTAN recursion depth}
\quad\leftrightarrow\quad
\text{cortical temporal depth}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">LLM&nbsp;depth</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">↔</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">TARTAN&nbsp;recursion&nbsp;depth</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">↔</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">cortical&nbsp;temporal&nbsp;depth</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="6446" data-end="6467">This closes the loop.</p>
<hr data-start="6469" data-end="6472">
<h1 data-start="6474" data-end="6495"><strong data-start="6476" data-end="6495">7. Key Takeaway</strong></h1>
<p data-start="6497" data-end="6665"><strong data-start="6497" data-end="6665">RSVP provides the fields.<br data-start="6524" data-end="6527">
TARTAN provides the recursion.<br data-start="6557" data-end="6560">
Amplistwistors provide the nonlinear transformations.<br data-start="6613" data-end="6616">
Cymatic resonance provides the synchronization.</strong></p>
<p data-start="6667" data-end="6846">Together, they produce a coherent model of the brain as a <strong data-start="6725" data-end="6771">resonance-driven recursive semantic engine</strong>—precisely the architecture reflected in high-resolution neuroscience data.</p>
<hr data-start="6848" data-end="6851">
