</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>F: K </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\to</span></span><span> H</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>k(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>, there exists a finite composition of
amplistwistors </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{A}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{i</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>1}, </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\dots</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{A}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{i</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>m}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> such that

