</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Stability of Amplistwistor Cascades}

The recursive application of nonlinear operators poses the risk of instability
or divergence. To ensure meaningful computation, we require sufficient
conditions under which amplistwistor cascades remain bounded.

