</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> implies </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\alpha</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span>)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\tau</span></span><span>(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span>)</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\le</span></span><span> C</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>. Contractivity
of </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\pi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> then yields </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{k+1}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\le</span></span><span> C</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Psi</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>k</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>. Iteration preserves the
