with </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\theta</span></span><span>=1 - 2/p</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{Poincaré Inequality}

Since </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> is compact and boundaryless:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span>u - </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\bar</span></span><span>{u}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{L</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2} </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\le</span></span><span> C</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>P </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>g u</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\|</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{L</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2},
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\qquad</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\bar</span></span><span>{u} = </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{1}{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathrm</span></span><span>{vol}(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M})} </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\int</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">_</span></span><span>{</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M}} u.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>

If desired, we may impose </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\bar</span></span><span>{u}=0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> by subtracting the mean.

