</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{theorem}[Stone--Weierstrass for Amplistwistors]
The algebra generated by amplistwistors is dense in
</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>C</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>0(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{M};</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbb</span></span><span>{R}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>d)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> under the uniform norm.
