achieve </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\varepsilon</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>-approximation satisfies
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
n(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\varepsilon</span></span><span>)
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\le</span></span><span>
C </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\varepsilon</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>{-d/k},
