12.4 Completeness of resonant expansion<br data-start="2038" data-end="2041">
12.5 Spatial organization of resonant modes</p>
<p data-start="2088" data-end="2367"><strong data-start="2088" data-end="2143">Section 13: Cymatic Resonance on the Cortical Sheet</strong><br data-start="2143" data-end="2146">
13.1 Resonance from driven RSVP PDE<br data-start="2181" data-end="2184">
13.2 Nonlinear mode-locking via TARTAN recursion<br data-start="2232" data-end="2235">
13.3 Energy transfer across modes<br data-start="2268" data-end="2271">
13.4 Entropy modulation and spectral broadening<br data-start="2318" data-end="2321">
