8em;">g</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="5864" data-end="6069">This expansion is the foundation for the analysis of cymatic resonance and global synchronization in later sections. It also enables rigorous translation of the RSVP field equations into modal coordinates.</p>
