<p data-start="3471" data-end="3625">Such interactions may create phase-locked relationships among modes, especially when $\omega_j$ and $\omega_k$ satisfy rational relations with $\omega_m$.</p>
<p data-start="3627" data-end="3677">\subsection{Energy Transfer and Spectral Cascades}</p>
<p data-start="3679" data-end="3764">Nonlinear terms enable transfer of energy between modes. Consider the energy identity</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mo mathvariant="normal" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">′</mo></msubsup><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi><mo mathvariant="normal" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">′</mo></msubsup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t} \left( \frac12 \sum_m \left(|A_m'|^2 + \lambda_m A_m^2 \right)\right)
