<p data-start="5593" data-end="5760">which decays rapidly with $m$ if $\gamma_m$ is sufficiently large. This results in functional brain states dominated by a small number of low-frequency resonant modes.</p>
<p data-start="5762" data-end="5819">\subsection{Cymatic Resonance as an Organizing Principle}</p>
<p data-start="5821" data-end="5943">In summary, the following properties justify the interpretation of eigenmodes as cymatic resonances of the cortical sheet:</p>
<ol data-start="5945" data-end="6370">
<li data-start="5945" data-end="6030">
<p data-start="5948" data-end="6030">Eigenfunctions form spatial standing waves determined solely by cortical geometry.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6031" data-end="6097">
<p data-start="6034" data-end="6097">Intrinsic frequencies are fixed by $\omega_m=\sqrt{\lambda_m}$.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6098" data-end="6187">
<p data-start="6101" data-end="6187">Neural dynamics under periodic drive amplify modes satisfying the resonance condition.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6188" data-end="6263">
<p data-start="6191" data-end="6263">Nonlinear interactions create mode locking and coherent global patterns.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6264" data-end="6370">
<p data-start="6267" data-end="6370">Physiological states modulate the spectrum through damping, metric perturbations, and entropy coupling.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="6372" data-end="6720">The eigenmode structure thus acts as a geometric and dynamical scaffold that constrains and organizes large-scale cortical activity. The next section incorporates local nonlinear operators from the RSVP dynamics into this resonant global structure, establishing a mathematically precise link between amplistwistor cascades and mode synchronization.</p>
<hr data-start="6722" data-end="6725">
<p data-start="6727" data-end="6820" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">I can now proceed to <strong data-start="6748" data-end="6803">Section 14: Coupling Eigenmodes with Amplistwistors</strong>, fully in LaTeX.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 1