<p data-start="471" data-end="525">\section{Empirical Predictions from Spectral Geometry}</p>
<p data-start="527" data-end="580">\subsection{Frequency Ranges for Resonant Eigenmodes}</p>
<p data-start="582" data-end="665">The eigenfrequencies of the Neumann Laplacian on the cortical manifold are given by</p>
