<p data-start="1084" data-end="1300">Taking the typical cortical surface area of approximately $1800 \ \mathrm{cm}^2$ and empirically calibrated Laplacian scalings from structural MRI reconstructions, we obtain predicted ranges for resonant frequencies:</p>
