n></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1431" data-end="1672">with higher modes occupying the gamma band and beyond. These predicted bands align with common electrophysiological oscillations, suggesting that canonical EEG/MEG frequency bands may reflect geometric eigenfrequencies of the cortical sheet.</p>
<p data-start="1674" data-end="1742">\subsection{Spatial Localization in Electrophysiological Signatures}</p>
<p data-start="1744" data-end="1984">Eigenfunctions $u_m$ with small indices exhibit low spatial frequency and extend over large cortical regions. In contrast, high-frequency eigenfunctions oscillate rapidly and concentrate around regions of high curvature or anatomical folds.</p>
<p data-start="1986" data-end="2003">Thus, we predict:</p>
<p data-start="2005" data-end="2494">\begin{enumerate}<br>
\item Low-frequency oscillations (delta, theta) correspond to activation of modes $m\in{0,1,2,\dots,20}$, displaying large-scale coherence across multiple gyri and sulci.<br>
\item Alpha and beta oscillations (8--30 Hz) correspond to mid-range modes whose eigenfunctions exhibit intermediate spatial structure.<br>
\item Gamma oscillations (30--100 Hz) arise from higher modes localized along sulcal boundaries where curvature and metric gradients are greatest.<br>
\end{enumerate}</p>
<p data-start="2496" data-end="2727">This yields a testable hypothesis: the spatial topography of oscillatory activity at distinct frequency bands should approximate the shapes of low-, mid-, and high-index Neumann eigenfunctions on subject-specific cortical surfaces.</p>
<p data-start="2729" data-end="2783">\subsection{Phase Relationships and Mode Interference}</p>
<p data-start="2785" data-end="2915">Let $A_m(t)=R_m(t)e^{i\theta_m(t)}$ denote the complex modal amplitude for the $m$-th mode. The modal decomposition predicts that:</p>
<p data-start="2917" data-end="3033">\begin{enumerate}<br>
\item Modes with close eigenfrequencies $\omega_m\approx\omega_j$ will exhibit slow phase beating:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\theta_{mj}(t)= (\omega_m-\omega_j)t + O(\varepsilon),</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0361em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord">Δ</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">θ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">mj</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0361em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">ε</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3101" data-end="3226">producing amplitude modulation in MEG/EEG at the beat frequency.<br>
\item Nonlinear interactions produce phase locking such that</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">c</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">n</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\theta_m(t)-\theta_j(t)| &lt; \mathrm{constant}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">θ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0361em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">θ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&lt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6151em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">constant</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3279" data-end="3427">during episodes of strong coherence.<br>
\item Triplet interactions via coefficients $c_{mjk}$ generate signatures of cross-frequency coupling, such as:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_k \approx \theta_j + \theta_m,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8444em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">θ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9805em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">θ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span c