<p data-start="6919" data-end="7064">This establishes a formal mechanism by which the RSVP system produces the layered temporal hierarchy observed empirically in cortical processing.</p>
<p data-start="7066" data-end="7117">\subsection{Recursive Amplification Through TARTAN}</p>
<p data-start="7119" data-end="7248">TARTAN recursion introduces additional structure by applying amplistwistors at discrete time intervals $\Delta t$. In modal form:</p>
