We use:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla\Phi = \sum_j \phi_j \nabla u_j,
