<p data-start="5822" data-end="5979">The modal system becomes:<br>
\begin{equation}<br>
\partial_t \mathbf{a} = \mathcal{L}\mathbf{a} + \mathcal{N}(\mathbf{a}),<br>
\label{17-abstract}<br>
\end{equation}<br>
where:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">i</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L} = 
