<p data-start="7893" data-end="7899">where:</p>
<p data-start="7901" data-end="7993">\begin{enumerate}<br>
\item $\mathbf{a}_S(t)$ evolves according to a closed nonlinear subsystem,</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">a</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="script">L</mi><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">a</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="script">N</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="bold">a</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\partial_t \mathbf{a}_S 
