<p data-start="6214" data-end="6271">which measures how strongly mode $m$ responds to forcing.</p>
<p data-start="6273" data-end="6373">\begin{proposition}[Mode Selection Principle]<br>
For small amplitude inputs, the modal energy satisfies</p>
