<p data-start="3362" data-end="3375">\end{theorem}</p>
<p data-start="3377" data-end="3619">\begin{proof}<br>
Standard results for SPDEs on Hilbert spaces apply (Da Prato–Zabczyk framework). The locally Lipschitz and coercivity assumptions ensure global existence, while Hilbert–Schmidt noise guarantees finite second moments.<br>
\end{proof}</p>
