<p data-start="230" data-end="395">However, because this is a <strong data-start="257" data-end="323">very long and mathematically dense paper (likely 60–120 pages)</strong>, I need one bit of clarification before generating the full LaTeX file:</p>
<hr data-start="397" data-end="400">
<h1 data-start="402" data-end="473">❓ <strong data-start="406" data-end="473">Crucial Clarification Before I Generate the Full LaTeX Document</strong></h1>
<p data-start="475" data-end="515">You want citations throughout the essay.</p>
<p data-start="517" data-end="564">There are <strong data-start="527" data-end="539">two ways</strong> to handle the citations:</p>
<hr data-start="566" data-end="569">
<h3 data-start="571" data-end="630"><strong data-start="575" data-end="630">Option A — Real citations to actual published works</strong></h3>
<p data-start="632" data-end="652">These would include:</p>
