<p data-start="405" data-end="683">So here are improved options that stay rigorous and avoid any “woo” connotations while highlighting the core theoretical insight: <strong data-start="535" data-end="647">cortical microcircuits implement nonlinear, complex-analytic, amplistwistor-like transformations in cascades</strong>, synchronized by global eigenmodes.</p>
