<p data-start="1549" data-end="1594">Concise and captures the entire architecture.</p>
<h3 data-start="1596" data-end="1719"><strong data-start="1600" data-end="1719">5. A Relativistic Field Model of Cortical Computation: Amplitwistor Cascades and Large-Scale Eigenmode Coordination</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1721" data-end="1754">More formal, broader positioning.</p>
<h3 data-start="1756" data-end="1849"><strong data-start="1760" data-end="1849">6. Semantic Field Dynamics in Cortex: Amplitwistor Cascades and Modal Synchronization</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1851" data-end="1956">Avoids “resonance”, uses “modal synchronization”, a canonical phrase in dynamical systems + neuroscience.</p>
<h3 data-start="1958" data-end="2070"><strong data-start="1962" data-end="2070">7. Amplitwistors in the Brain: Nonlinear Transformations and Eigenmode Structure in Cortical Computation</strong></h3>
