<p data-start="276" data-end="486">Since you want <strong data-start="291" data-end="316">“a lot of references”</strong>, I will build a <em data-start="333" data-end="348">comprehensive</em>, publication-quality <code data-start="370" data-end="376">.bib</code> file of approximately <strong data-start="399" data-end="432">60–100 high-quality citations</strong>, all <strong data-start="438" data-end="485">real, verifiable, mainstream academic works</strong>.</p>
