="f35cccef-85c5-4b92-9ef1-a237f2ec6e54" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="112">Excellent — I can absolutely do that, and it will <strong data-start="50" data-end="80">raise the academic quality</strong> of the manuscript dramatically.</p>
<p data-start="114" data-end="158">To proceed properly, here is what I will do:</p>
<hr data-start="160" data-end="163">
<h1 data-start="165" data-end="186">✅ <strong data-start="169" data-end="186">What You Want</strong></h1>
<p data-start="187" data-end="252">You want <strong data-start="196" data-end="245">all (or nearly all) of the 90–150+ references</strong> to be:</p>
<ol data-start="254" data-end="533">
<li data-start="254" data-end="300">
<p data-start="257" data-end="300"><strong data-start="257" data-end="297">Cited explicitly throughout the text</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="301" data-end="346">
<p data-start="304" data-end="346">In <strong data-start="307" data-end="343">the correct scientific locations</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="347" data-end="395">
<p data-start="350" data-end="395">With <strong data-start="355" data-end="392">relevant contextual justification</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="396" data-end="451">
<p data-start="399" data-end="451">In <strong data-start="402" data-end="428">natural academic prose</strong> (not bullet points),</p>
</li>
<li data-start="452" data-end="533">
<p data-start="455" data-end="533">Without artificially stuffing citations, but ensuring they appear organically.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="535" data-end="599">This is exactly how a serious monograph-level paper should read.</p>
<hr data-start="601" data-end="604">
<h1 data-start="606" data-end="644">✅ <strong data-start="610" data-end="644">How I Will Integrate Citations</strong></h1>
<p data-start="645" data-end="683">To cite “as many as possible”, I will:</p>
<h3 data-start="685" data-end="755">1. <strong data-start="692" data-end="717">Go section by section</strong>, and ensure each key idea references:</h3>
<ul data-start="756" data-end="1125">
