<p data-start="307" data-end="616">The exposition links amplistwistors to universal approximation theorems, extends these results to functions on compact manifolds, includes proofs and proof sketches, and cites all appropriate classical and modern sources, including Cybenko, Hornik, Poggio–Girosi, and relevant functional analytic foundations.</p>
