<p data-start="287" data-end="626">It provides the numerical and computational machinery required to simulate the amplitwistor cascade model on realistic cortical manifolds, bringing together parabolic PDE theory, spectral geometry, finite element discretization, and semilinear operator-splitting techniques. It is written to integrate seamlessly with the previous section.</p>
