ional details present in the current draft while eliminating redundancy through dedicated, non-overlapping sections for empirical evidence and experimental predictions. This outline maintains a logical progression from foundational neuroscience and geometry to advanced theoretical results, alignment with empirical data, and broader implications, ensuring cohesion without fragmentation.

