<h3 data-start="2898" data-end="2947"><strong data-start="2902" data-end="2947">14. Simulation Studies on Cortical Meshes</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2948" data-end="3039">Finite element discretization, eigenmode extraction, amplitwistor dynamics, synthetic ECoG.</p>
<h3 data-start="3041" data-end="3103"><strong data-start="3045" data-end="3103">15. Experimental Predictions and Testable Consequences</strong></h3>
<p data-start="3104" data-end="3227">Quantitative predictions, phase–amplitude coupling, eigenmode suppression, vorticity signatures, temporal dilation metrics.</p>
<h3 data-start="3229" data-end="3281"><strong data-start="3233" data-end="3281">16. Implications for Artificial Intelligence</strong></h3>
