<p data-start="134" data-end="503">It synthesizes the geometry–dynamics–cognition relationship, clarifies the contributions of the amplitwistor–eigenmode framework, situates it within current theoretical neuroscience, and prepares the path for the concluding section. No lists or bullet points are used, and several core references are invoked implicitly through the exposition and can be cited directly.</p>
