"016061e7-b5b6-4980-9517-20f1a2fac546" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="151">Excellent — here is an upgraded, <strong data-start="33" data-end="64">LuaLaTeX-optimized Makefile</strong> that includes <strong data-start="79" data-end="97">ChkTeX linting</strong>, while keeping the latexmk workflow clean and robust.</p>
<p data-start="153" data-end="165">I made sure:</p>
<ul data-start="167" data-end="331">
<li data-start="167" data-end="207">
<p data-start="169" data-end="207">It <em data-start="172" data-end="179">never</em> interferes with LuaLaTeX.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="208" data-end="257">
<p data-start="210" data-end="257">ChkTeX warnings are optional but easy to use.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="258" data-end="331">
<p data-start="260" data-end="331">The file is clean, readable, and tuned for large projects like yours.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="333" data-end="383">Below is the complete upgraded Makefile including:</p>
<ul data-start="385" data-end="573">
<li data-start="385" data-end="419">
<p data-start="387" data-end="419"><strong data-start="387" data-end="398">latexmk</strong> for the main build</p>
</li>
<li data-start="420" data-end="479">
<p data-start="422" data-end="479"><strong data-start="422" data-end="440">ChkTeX linting</strong> on all <code data-start="448" data-end="454">.tex</code> files or selected ones</p>
</li>
<li data-start="480" data-end="527">
<p data-start="482" data-end="527"><strong data-start="482" data-end="514">A lint-before-build pipeline</strong> (optional)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="528" data-end="573">
<p data-start="530" data-end="573"><strong data-start="530" data-end="544">Watch mode</strong>, <strong data-start="546" data-end="555">clean</strong>, <strong data-start="557" data-end="565">tikz</strong>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="575" data-end="578">
<h1 data-start="580" data-end="629">✅ <strong data-start="584" data-end="629">Makefile (with ChkTeX integrated cleanly)</strong></h1>
