688L15.959 12.3975C16.2466 12.2211 16.4808 11.9682 16.6348 11.666L16.6914 11.5361C16.7428 11.3924 16.7797 11.2026 16.8027 10.9209C16.8341 10.5374 16.835 10.0439 16.835 9.33301V6.5C16.835 5.78896 16.8341 5.29563 16.8027 4.91211C16.7797 4.63025 16.7428 4.44063 16.6914 4.29688L16.6348 4.16699C16.4807 3.86474 16.2466 3.61186 15.959 3.43555L15.833 3.36524C15.675 3.28473 15.4636 3.22797 15.0879 3.19727C14.7044 3.16593 14.211 3.16504 13.5 3.16504H10.667C9.9561 3.16504 9.46259 3.16595 9.0791 3.19727C8.79739 3.22028 8.6076 3.2572 8.46387 3.30859L8.33399 3.36524C8.03176 3.51923 7.77886 3.75343 7.60254 4.04102L7.53125 4.16699C7.4508 4.32498 7.39397 4.53655 7.36328 4.91211C7.33985 5.19893 7.33562 5.54719 7.33399 6.00195H9.33301C10.022 6.00195 10.5791 6.00131 11.0293 6.03809C11.4873 6.07551 11.8937 6.15471 12.2705 6.34668L12.4883 6.46875C12.984 6.7728 13.3878 7.20854 13.6533 7.72949L13.7197 7.87207C13.8642 8.20859 13.9292 8.56974 13.9619 8.9707C13.9987 9.42092 13.998 9.97799 13.998 10.667V12.665ZM18.165 9.33301C18.165 10.022 18.1657 10.5791 18.1289 11.0293C18.0961 11.4302 18.0311 11.7914 17.8867 12.1279L17.8203 12.2705C17.5549 12.7914 17.1509 13.2272 16.6553 13.5313L16.4365 13.6533C16.0599 13.8452 15.6541 13.9245 15.1963 13.9619C14.8593 13.9895 14.4624 13.9935 13.9951 13.9951C13.9935 14.4624 13.9895 14.8593 13.9619 15.1963C13.9292 15.597 13.864 15.9576 13.7197 16.2939L13.6533 16.4365C13.3878 16.9576 12.9841 17.3941 12.4883 17.6982L12.2705 17.8203C11.8937 18.0123 11.4873 18.0915 11.0293 18.1289C10.5791 18.1657 10.022 18.165 9.33301 18.165H6.5C5.81091 18.165 5.25395 18.1657 4.80371 18.1289C4.40306 18.0962 4.04235 18.031 3.70606 17.8867L3.56348 17.8203C3.04244 17.5548 2.60585 17.151 2.30176 16.6553L2.17969 16.4365C1.98788 16.0599 1.90851 15.6541 1.87109 15.1963C1.83431 14.746 1.83496 14.1891 1.83496 13.5V10.667C1.83496 9.978 1.83432 9.42091 1.87109 8.9707C1.90851 8.5127 1.98772 8.10625 2.17969 7.72949L2.30176 7.51172C2.60586 7.0159 3.04236 6.6122 3.56348 6.34668L3.70606 6.28027C4.04237 6.136 4.40303 6.07083 4.80371 6.03809C5.14051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Copy code</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-Makefile"><span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Makefile for LuaLaTeX + Biber + latexmk + ChkTeX</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Project: Cortical Columns as Amplitwistor Cascades</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Author: Flyxion</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>

TARGET = main

LATEXMK = latexmk
LATEXMK_OPTS = -lualatex -halt-on-error -interaction=nonstopmode

BIBER = biber
CHK = chktex

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Colors for pretty output</span></span><span>
GREEN  = \033[0;32m
YELLOW = \033[1;33m
RED    = \033[0;31m
RESET  = \033[0m


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Default: Build PDF using latexmk</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">all:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Building PDF with LuaLaTeX + latexmk...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK_OPTS)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(GREEN)</span></span></span><span>Build complete: </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.pdf</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Linting: Run ChkTeX on all TeX sources</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">lint:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Running ChkTeX on all TeX files...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(CHK)</span></span><span> -n1 -n8 -n46 -I0 </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex
	@find sections -name </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"*.tex"</span></span><span> -exec </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(CHK)</span></span><span> -n1 -n8 -n46 -I0 {} \;
	@find appendices -name </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"*.tex"</span></span><span> -exec </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(CHK)</span></span><span> -n1 -n8 -n46 -I0 {} \;
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(GREEN)</span></span></span><span>ChkTeX linting complete.</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Build only after linting succeeds (soft failure allowed)</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">safe:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Linting before build...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(CHK)</span></span><span> -q -I0 </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex || true
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Lint warnings ignored; proceeding with build.</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK_OPTS)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Run manual LuaLaTeX → Biber → LuaLaTeX chain</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">manual:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Running LuaLaTeX...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@lualatex -halt-on-error -interaction=nonstopmode </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex

	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Running Biber...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(BIBER)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>

	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Finalizing LuaLaTeX passes...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@lualatex -halt-on-error -interaction=nonstopmode </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex
	@lualatex -halt-on-error -interaction=nonstopmode </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex

	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(GREEN)</span></span></span><span>Manual build complete: </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.pdf</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Watch mode: auto-compile on change</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">watch:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Watching for changes (Ctrl+C to stop)...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK_OPTS)</span></span><span> -pvc </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># TikZ externalization (requires --shell-escape)</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">tikz:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Building with TikZ externalization...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK)</span></span><span> -pdflatex=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"lualatex -shell-escape"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK_OPTS)</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.tex


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Clean auxiliary files but keep PDF</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">clean:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(YELLOW)</span></span></span><span>Cleaning auxiliary files...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK)</span></span><span> -c
	@rm -f </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.bbl </span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(TARGET)</span></span><span>.run.xml
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(GREEN)</span></span></span><span>Auxiliary files removed.</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># Remove absolutely everything, including PDF</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-section">cleanall:</span></span><span>
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(RED)</span></span></span><span>Cleaning ALL generated files, including PDF...</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"
	@</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(LATEXMK)</span></span><span> -C
	@echo </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"<span class="hljs-variable">$(GREEN)</span></span></span><span>Project cleaned.</span><span><span class="hljs-variable">$(RESET)</span></span><span>"


</span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-meta"><span class="hljs-keyword">.PHONY</span></span></span><span>: all lint safe manual watch tikz clean cleanall
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="4329" data-end="4332">
<h1 data-start="4334" data-end="4363">📌 How ChkTeX Is Integrated</h1>
<p data-start="4365" data-end="4400">You now have <strong data-start="4378" data-end="4399">two linting modes</strong>:</p>
<h3 data-start="4402" data-end="4419">✔ <code data-start="4408" data-end="4419">make lint</code></h3>
<p data-start="4420" data-end="4474">Runs ChkTeX with human-readable output, warnings only.</p>
<h3 data-start="4476" data-end="4493">✔ <code data-start="4482" data-end="4493">make safe</code></h3>
<p data-start="4494" data-end="4603">Runs ChkTeX first, <em data-start="4513" data-end="4542">but does not stop the build</em>.<br data-start="4543" data-end="4546">
This is ideal when you want warnings but no interruption.</p>
<p data-start="4605" data-end="4771">You can enforce strict linting (fail on warnings) if you prefer, but I kept the default permissive because large academic documents tend to trigger harmless warnings.</p>
<hr data-start="4773" data-end="4776">
<h1 data-start="4778" data-end="4829">🧠 Why This Version Works Well for LuaLaTeX Users</h1>
<ul data-start="4831" data-end="5086">
<li data-start="4831" data-end="4871">
<p data-start="4833" data-end="4871"><strong data-start="4833" data-end="4869">latexmk handles LuaLaTeX cleanly</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4872" data-end="4907">
<p data-start="4874" data-end="4907"><strong data-start="4874" data-end="4905">Biber runs only when needed</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4908" data-end="4971">
<p data-start="4910" data-end="4971">ChkTeX is <strong data-start="4920" data-end="4937">non-intrusive</strong>, optional, but always available</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4972" data-end="5024">
<p data-start="4974" data-end="5024">The commands are predictable and well-structured</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5025" data-end="5086">
<p data-start="5027" data-end="5086">Clean separation between build, lint, and debugging modes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5088" data-end="5091">
<h1 data-start="5093" data-end="5133">🔧 Optional Enhancements (If You Want)</h1>
<p data-start="5135" data-end="5150">I can also add:</p>
<h3 data-start="5152" data-end="5196">■ <strong data-start="5158" data-end="5180">ChkTeX ignore file</strong> (<code data-start="5182" data-end="5193">.chktexrc</code>)</h3>
<p data-start="5197" data-end="5227">To suppress specific warnings.</p>
<h3 data-start="5229" data-end="5285">■ <strong data-start="5235" data-end="5283">Makefile flag to toggle TikZ externalization</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5286" data-end="5331">(auto-use shell-escape when TikZ files exist)</p>
<h3 data-start="5333" data-end="5375">■ <strong data-start="5339" data-end="5373">Git pre-commit hook for ChkTeX</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5376" data-end="5424">Prevents committing TeX files with major errors.</p>
<h3 data-start="5426" data-end="5463">■ <strong data-start="5432" data-end="5461">Integration with tectonic</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5464" data-end="5514">Sometimes faster than LuaLaTeX, but less flexible.</p>
<hr data-start="5516" data-end="5519">
<p data-start="5521" data-end="5536">Would you like:</p>
<ul data-start="5538" data-end="5786">
<li data-start="5538" data-end="5603">
<p data-start="5540" data-end="5603">A <strong data-start="5542" data-end="5562"><code data-start="5544" data-end="5555">.chktexrc</code> file</strong> tuned for academic mathematical prose?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5604" data-end="5688">
<p data-start="5606" data-end="5688">A <strong data-start="5608" data-end="5629">GitHub Actions CI</strong> that uses this Makefile to build your PDF automatically?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5689" data-end="5786">
<p data-start="5691" data-end="5786">Or a <strong data-start="5696" data-end="5719">Shell/Python script</strong> that compiles individual sections separately for faster iteration?</p>
</li>
