<h1 data-start="3156" data-end="3210">🔍 Why this <code data-start="3170" data-end="3181">.chktexrc</code> is ideal for your manuscript</h1>
<p data-start="3212" data-end="3234">Your project includes:</p>
<ul data-start="3236" data-end="3392">
<li data-start="3236" data-end="3269">
<p data-start="3238" data-end="3269">long mathematical derivations</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3270" data-end="3293">
<p data-start="3272" data-end="3293">custom environments</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3294" data-end="3310">
