<hr data-start="4493" data-end="4496">
<h1 data-start="4498" data-end="4543">⚙️ Optional Enhancements for GitHub Actions</h1>
<p data-start="4545" data-end="4589">I can generate additional workflows for you:</p>
<ul data-start="4591" data-end="4895">
<li data-start="4591" data-end="4673">
<p data-start="4593" data-end="4673"><strong data-start="4593" data-end="4626">Faster TeX Live installation:</strong> using a minimal TL + only necessary packages</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4674" data-end="4731">
<p data-start="4676" data-end="4731"><strong data-start="4676" data-end="4694">Cache TeX Live</strong> to dramatically reduce build times</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4732" data-end="4787">
<p data-start="4734" data-end="4787"><strong data-start="4734" data-end="4764">Automatic release creation</strong> when the PDF changes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4788" data-end="4850">
<p data-start="4790" data-end="4850"><strong data-start="4790" data-end="4813">Validate references</strong> using <code data-start="4820" data-end="4848">biber --validate-datamodel</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4851" data-end="4895">
<p data-start="4853" data-end="4895"><strong data-start="4853" data-end="4893">Compile both full and draft versions</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4897" data-end="4938">If you'd like any of these, just tell me:</p>
<p data-start="4940" data-end="5079">➡️ <em data-start="4943" data-end="4973">“Add caching to speed up CI”</em><br data-start="4973" data-end="4976">
➡️ <em data-start="4979" data-end="5019">“Create a release when the PDF builds”</em><br data-start="5019" data-end="5022">
➡️ <em data-start="5025" data-end="5077">“Add a draft build with fast TikZ externalization”</em></p>
