    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"## 1. Stimulus: Word Onsets and Durations\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"We simulate a one-dimensional \"time\" axis and a sequence of word onsets.\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Each word is assigned a duration and an onset time. This is a simplification\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"of the 30-minute narrative paradigm, but sufficient to capture temporal structure."</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
