   "</span>metadata<span class="hljs-string">": {},
   "</span>source<span class="hljs-string">": [
    "</span>## </span><span><span class="hljs-number">4.</span></span><span> Construct Time-Resolved Regressors for Each Layer\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>To build encoding models</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span> we need continuous-time regressors. For each layer\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>and dimension</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span> we construct a time series by placing impulses at word onsets\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>scaled by the corresponding embedding value</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span> and then optionally smoothing\n<span class="hljs-string">",
