    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"## 5. Generate Synthetic Neural Signals per Region\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"We generate a single synthetic \"neural channel\" per region by:\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"1. Choosing a subset of layers and dimensions to contribute.\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"2. Convolving each time series with the region's temporal kernel.\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
