    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"This creates a ground-truth mapping from LLM features to region-specific\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"signals with known temporal characteristics."</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
