   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"cell_type"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"markdown"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"metadata"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"source"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"## 6. Encoding Model: Layer × Lag Prediction\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"We now build a simple encoding model: for each layer and lag, we ask how well\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"a scalar summary of the layer's features predicts the neural signal.\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"For simplicity, we compress each layer's embedding at each word into a single\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"scalar (e.g. by random projection), then build a time series and shift it\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"by different lags. We measure prediction quality using Pearson correlation.\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"This is not a full regression across all dimensions, but captures the key\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"alignment structure between layer depth and temporal lag."</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"cell_type"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"code"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"execution_count"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-literal"><span class="hljs-keyword">null</span></span></span><span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"metadata"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
