<p data-start="7388" data-end="7472">See how the <strong data-start="7400" data-end="7421">layer–lag mapping</strong> changes when you impose that nonlinear geometry.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="7473" data-end="7533">
<p data-start="7475" data-end="7533">Compare temporal window widths before and after warping.</p>
</li>
</ul>
