   </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">"source"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"## 2. RSVP Fields with External Drive\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"We implement a simplified RSVP system with a scalar field Φ, a two-component\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"vector field v = (v_x, v_y), and an entropy field S. An external input I(x, y, t)\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"drives the Φ equation. The input is constructed by multiplying a scalar drive\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"s(t) with a spatial pattern P(x, y).\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"The evolution has the form\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\\begin{align}\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\\dot{\\Phi} &amp;= c_1 \\nabla^2 \\Phi + c_2 \\Phi \\, \\omega - c_3 S \\Phi + k_{\\text{in}} I(x, y, t),\\\\\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\\dot{v} &amp;= c_4 \\nabla \\Phi + c_5 \\nabla \\times v - c_6 S v,\\\\\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\\dot{S} &amp;= c_7 |\\nabla \\cdot v| + c_8 \\Phi^2 - c_9 S,\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\\end{align}\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"where ω is the scalar curl of v in two dimensions and k_in controls the strength\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"of coupling between the language drive and the scalar field."</span></span><span>
   </span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span></span><span>
