    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"## 4. Eigenmodes of the Discrete Laplacian\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"To analyze the response of the field in terms of resonant spatial patterns,\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"we compute a small number of eigenmodes of the discrete Laplacian on the grid.\n"</span></span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"These modes correspond to standing-wave patterns on the manifold and provide\n,
    "</span>a simple way to track which spatial structures are amplified by the drive.<span class="hljs-string">"
   ]
  },
  {
   "</span>cell_type</span><span><span class="hljs-string">": "</span></span><span>code<span class="hljs-string">",
   "</span>execution_count<span class="hljs-string">": null,
   "</span>metadata<span class="hljs-string">": {},
   "</span>outputs<span class="hljs-string">": [],
   "</span>source<span class="hljs-string">": [
    "</span>def build_laplacian_matrix(N)</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span></span><span>\n<span class="hljs-string">",
