    "</span>of deep models. The spatial pattern P(x</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span> y) can be taken from empirical activation\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>maps or eigenmodes of a more realistic cortical mesh. The mapping from drive to\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>field can be adjusted to explore different coupling schemes</span><span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span></span><span> including feedback\n<span class="hljs-string">",
    "</span>from Φ back into s(t) or between different regions of interest.<span class="hljs-string">"
   ]
  }
