</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1527" data-end="1634"><strong data-start="1527" data-end="1559">Ideal for long-term clarity.</strong><br data-start="1559" data-end="1562">
If this becomes your <em data-start="1583" data-end="1610">“big cortex book chapter”</em>, standalone is cleaner.</p>
<hr data-start="1636" data-end="1639">
<h1 data-start="1641" data-end="1693">🗂 Option B — Put it inside <strong data-start="1671" data-end="1693">research-projects/</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="1694" data-end="1713">Recommended if:</h3>
<ul data-start="1714" data-end="1909">
<li data-start="1714" data-end="1790">
<p data-start="1716" data-end="1790">You want it to be part of the unified RSVP / TARTAN / HYDRA research body.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1791" data-end="1844">
<p data-start="1793" data-end="1844">You expect cross-referencing with other monographs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1845" data-end="1909">
<p data-start="1847" data-end="1909">You want all related field-theoretic manuscripts in one place.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1911" data-end="1924">Benefits:</h3>
<ul data-start="1925" data-end="2215">
<li data-start="1925" data-end="1971">
<p data-start="1927" data-end="1971">Fits your <em data-start="1937" data-end="1970">existing scholarly architecture</em>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1972" data-end="2045">
<p data-start="1974" data-end="2045">Simulations and PDE code can share components with other RSVP projects.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2046" data-end="2215">
<p data-start="2048" data-end="2084">The paper becomes part of a canon:</p>
