<h3 data-start="3604" data-end="3612">Why?</h3>
<p data-start="3613" data-end="3691">Because this manuscript is <em data-start="3640" data-end="3645">big</em>, <em data-start="3647" data-end="3657">rigorous</em>, <em data-start="3659" data-end="3668">modular</em>, and will evolve into:</p>
<ul data-start="3693" data-end="3860">
