</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2181" data-end="2197">Preface it with:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2198" data-end="2377">
<p data-start="2200" data-end="2377">“This appendix reproduces an earlier conceptual essay from &lt;date&gt; that anticipated several structures formalized in the main text, but lacks the present mathematical apparatus.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2379" data-end="2396">Clean and honest.</p>
<h3 data-start="2398" data-end="2472"><strong data-start="2402" data-end="2472">B. Integrate its strongest conceptual pieces into the introduction</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2473" data-end="2490">This is ideal if:</p>
<ul data-start="2492" data-end="2607">
<li data-start="2492" data-end="2553">
<p data-start="2494" data-end="2553">it contains metaphors or intuitively satisfying phrasing,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2554" data-end="2607">
<p data-start="2556" data-end="2607">you want it to serve as a “philosophical overview.”</p>
</li>
