a mathematical neuroscience project developing a geometric framework for
cortical computation. The work models cortical columns as
</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span></span></span><span>&gt;cascades of amplitwistor transformations</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span></span></span><span>&gt; acting on
