</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;

</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
The project unifies concepts from differential geometry, spectral theory,
neural field models, and large language model analysis. It connects these to
empirical findings from ECoG, MEG, EEG, and ultrafast fMRI to explain how
the brain implements hierarchical temporal processing.
