<p data-start="2213" data-end="2253">This is for publishers, not researchers.</p>
<hr data-start="2255" data-end="2258">
<h1 data-start="2260" data-end="2284">Recommendation for You</h1>
<h3 data-start="2286" data-end="2337"><strong data-start="2290" data-end="2335">Use Option A: the minimalist <code data-start="2321" data-end="2333">.gitignore</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start="2338" data-end="2341">It:</p>
<ul data-start="2343" data-end="2589">
<li data-start="2343" data-end="2391">
<p data-start="2345" data-end="2391">avoids clutter from irrelevant OS/editor files</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2392" data-end="2434">
<p data-start="2394" data-end="2434">preserves LaTeX logs and build artifacts</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2435" data-end="2494">
<p data-start="2437" data-end="2494">is fully compatible with your preference for transparency</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2495" data-end="2544">
<p data-start="2497" data-end="2544">avoids accidental loss of debugging information</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2545" data-end="2589">
<p data-start="2547" data-end="2589">makes the repo reproducible across systems</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2591" data-end="2594">
<h1 data-start="2596" data-end="2626">Additional Thought: Git LFS?</h1>
<p data-start="2628" data-end="2642">If you expect:</p>
<ul data-start="2644" data-end="2726">
<li data-start="2644" data-end="2674">
<p data-start="2646" data-end="2674">many figures (PNG, SVG, PDF)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2675" data-end="2692">
<p data-start="2677" data-end="2692">large notebooks</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2693" data-end="2705">
<p data-start="2695" data-end="2705">animations</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2706" data-end="2726">
<p data-start="2708" data-end="2726">simulation outputs</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2728" data-end="2853">Then using <strong data-start="2739" data-end="2771">Git LFS (Large File Storage)</strong> is a good idea.<br data-start="2787" data-end="2790">
It keeps the repo fast while allowing you to store large files.</p>
<p data-start="2855" data-end="2914">I can generate a <code data-start="2872" data-end="2888">.gitattributes</code> file for LFS if you want.</p>
<hr data-start="2916" data-end="2919">
<h1 data-start="2921" data-end="2956">If you want, I can also generate:</h1>
<h3 data-start="2958" data-end="3032">✓ A variant <code data-start="2974" data-end="2986">.gitignore</code> that <em data-start="2992" data-end="2998">only</em> ignores notebooks’ output cells</h3>
<h3 data-start="3033" data-end="3104">✓ A fully commented <code data-start="3057" data-end="3069">.gitignore</code> documenting why each line exists</h3>
<h3 data-start="3105" data-end="3143">✓ A <code data-start="3113" data-end="3129">.gitattributes</code> for Git LFS</h3>
<h3 data-start="3144" data-end="3212">✓ A repository README note explaining your archival philosophy</h3>
<h3 data-start="3213" data-end="3281">✓ A script to auto-backup logs into <code data-start="3253" data-end="3260">logs/</code> before each commit</h3>
<hr data-start="3283" data-end="3286">
<p data-start="3288" data-end="3317">Would you like me to prepare:</p>
<ul data-start="3319" data-end="3460">
<li data-start="3319" data-end="3343">
<p data-start="3321" data-end="3343">Option A (minimalist)?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3344" data-end="3362">
<p data-start="3346" data-end="3362">Option B (none)?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3363" data-end="3460">
<p data-start="3365" data-end="3460">Or a custom hybrid that preserves LaTeX logs but organizes them into a directory automatically?</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3462" data-end="3474" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Your choice.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6