<h1 data-start="5554" data-end="5581">✅ What This File Achieves</h1>
<p data-start="5583" data-end="5651">This is your <strong data-start="5596" data-end="5630">first completely formal result</strong> about amplitwistors:</p>
<h3 data-start="5653" data-end="5735"><strong data-start="5657" data-end="5733">The amplitwistor-generated algebra is equal to the full function algebra</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5736" data-end="5800">for a concrete case (<code data-start="5757" data-end="5768">M = Fin n</code>, <code data-start="5770" data-end="5777">F = ℝ</code>, simple amplitwistor).</p>
<ul data-start="5802" data-end="5990">
<li data-start="5802" data-end="5816">
<p data-start="5804" data-end="5816">No <code data-start="5807" data-end="5814">sorry</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="5817" data-end="5848">
<p data-start="5819" data-end="5848">Uses real Stone–Weierstrass</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5849" data-end="5886">
<p data-start="5851" data-end="5886">Demonstrates separation of points</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5887" data-end="5935">
<p data-start="5889" data-end="5935">Demonstrates constant functions are included</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5936" data-end="5990">
<p data-start="5938" data-end="5990">Concludes exact equality with <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C(M, \mathbb{R})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathbb">R</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5992" data-end="6040">This is a fully valid Lean mathematical theorem.</p>
