<h3 data-start="6533" data-end="6579"><strong data-start="6537" data-end="6577">3. A full Lean formalization roadmap</strong></h3>
<p data-start="6580" data-end="6644">Mapping sections of your LaTeX paper directly into Lean modules.</p>
<hr data-start="6646" data-end="6649">
<p data-start="6651" data-end="6682">Would you like to proceed with:</p>
<p data-start="6684" data-end="6972">A) <strong data-start="6687" data-end="6720">A richer 1D geometric example</strong> (with actual amplitwist rotations)?<br data-start="6756" data-end="6759">
