<hr data-start="3155" data-end="3158">
<h2 data-start="3160" data-end="3225"><strong data-start="3163" data-end="3223">Option A3 — Compact subset of ℝᵏ with manifold structure</strong></h2>
<p data-start="3226" data-end="3276">Simplest for Lean; avoids deep manifold machinery.</p>
<p data-start="3278" data-end="3324">Model:<br data-start="3284" data-end="3287">
