ssage+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="363">Below is a <strong data-start="11" data-end="43">fully academic LaTeX section</strong> suitable for insertion into your monograph.<br data-start="87" data-end="90">
It is written in expository, mathematical–theoretical prose with citations left implicit (you can add them later).<br data-start="204" data-end="207">
It explains the <em data-start="223" data-end="257">operadic semantics for SpherePop</em> and shows precisely how <em data-start="282" data-end="305">Amplitwistor cascades</em> arise as <em data-start="315" data-end="360">operad algebras acting on RSVP field states</em>.</p>
