<p data-start="4340" data-end="4587">In other words, <em data-start="4356" data-end="4442">the full hybrid operadic–semigroup dynamics converge in the strong operator topology</em>.<br data-start="4443" data-end="4446">
Crucially, operadic composition commutes with the Trotter limit because each pop operator is uniformly bounded on the relevant Banach spaces.</p>
