<p data-start="320" data-end="596">If you paste <strong data-start="333" data-end="393">your current full <code data-start="353" data-end="363">main.tex</code> and the list of input files</strong>, I can run a <em data-start="407" data-end="430">synthetic compilation</em> (a full pass through TeX syntax, package requirements, cross-references, environment balance, citations, and more) and return a <strong data-start="559" data-end="595">clean, compilation-ready version</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="598" data-end="601">
