<hr data-start="1099" data-end="1102">
<h2 data-start="1104" data-end="1188">If you want, I can reconstruct a complete <em data-start="1149" data-end="1161">compilable</em> LaTeX project from scratch</h2>
<p data-start="1190" data-end="1202">You can say:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1204" data-end="1313">
<p data-start="1206" data-end="1313"><strong data-start="1206" data-end="1313">“Just build the entire main.tex and directory structure from the outline, assuming all sections exist.”</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="1315" data-end="1335">And I will generate:</p>
<ul data-start="1337" data-end="1618">
<li data-start="1337" data-end="1365">
<p data-start="1339" data-end="1365">A fully working <code data-start="1355" data-end="1365">main.tex</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1366" data-end="1395">
<p data-start="1368" data-end="1395">Consistent <code data-start="1379" data-end="1389">\input{}</code> paths</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1396" data-end="1425">
<p data-start="1398" data-end="1425">A complete <code data-start="1409" data-end="1425">references.bib</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1426" data-end="1473">
<p data-start="1428" data-end="1473">All section stubs as compilable minimal files</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1474" data-end="1494">
<p data-start="1476" data-end="1494">Appendix structure</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1495" data-end="1518">
<p data-start="1497" data-end="1518">A working <code data-start="1507" data-end="1518">latexmkrc</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1519" data-end="1546">
<p data-start="1521" data-end="1546">A protective <code data-start="1534" data-end="1546">.gitignore</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1547" data-end="1618">
<p data-start="1549" data-end="1618">A Makefile that builds automatically with lualatex + biblatex + biber</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1620" data-end="1623">
<h2 data-start="1625" data-end="1653">If you're ready, send me:</h2>
<p data-start="1655" data-end="1744"><strong data-start="1655" data-end="1687">Option A — Your actual files</strong><br data-start="1687" data-end="1690">
I will fix them and return a fully functional project.</p>
<p data-start="1746" data-end="1854"><strong data-start="1746" data-end="1832">Option B — Ask me to generate the entire project skeleton &amp; main.tex automatically</strong><br data-start="1832" data-end="1835">
You can simply say:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1856" data-end="1937">
<p data-start="1858" data-end="1937"><strong data-start="1858" data-end="1937">“Generate the complete main.tex and all section files following Outline B.”</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1939" data-end="1942">
<h3 data-start="1944" data-end="1973">I’m ready when you are.</h3>
