</li>
<li data-start="482" data-end="519">
<p data-start="484" data-end="519">semigroup evolution between them,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="520" data-end="566">
<p data-start="522" data-end="566">cascades as multiscale cortical computation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
